flowchart TB
    A([Operator presses<br/>Start scan]) --> B[Nav2 + m-explore-ros2<br/>autonomous frontier exploration]
    B --> C{Sensors active?}
    C -- no --> D[Abort with diagnostic] --> A
    C -- yes --> E[slam_toolbox async<br/>builds /map]
    E --> F[robot_localization EKF<br/>fuses /odom + /imu]
    F --> G[Compliance engine<br/>subscribes to /scan, /imu/data, /odom, /map]

    G --> H[[Ramp slope node<br/>IMPLEMENTED]]
    G --> I[[Trip hazard node<br/>STRETCH]]
    G --> J[[Path width node<br/>STRETCH]]
    G --> K[[Ramp width node<br/>ARCHITECTED]]
    G --> L[[Ramp landing node<br/>ARCHITECTED]]
    G --> M[[Door clear width node<br/>ARCHITECTED]]
    G --> N[[Door threshold node<br/>ARCHITECTED]]

    H --> O{LiDAR + IMU agree<br/>within 0.5 deg?}
    O -- no --> P[Mark frame re-scan<br/>log diagnostic]
    O -- yes --> Q{Slope > 4.76 deg?}
    Q -- yes --> R[Record violation<br/>CSV + PNG thumbnail<br/>/odom pose]
    Q -- no --> S[Record passing measurement]

    R --> T[reportlab PDF generator]
    S --> T
    P --> T

    T --> U([star_audit_report_TS.pdf])
    U --> V([extras/validation_log.csv])

    classDef implemented fill:#2a9d8f,stroke:#2a9d8f,color:#ffffff;
    classDef stretch fill:#c26e1a,stroke:#f4a261,color:#ffffff;
    classDef architected fill:#6c6c82,stroke:#9090a8,color:#ffffff;

    class H implemented
    class I,J stretch
    class K,L,M,N architected
